---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout locale="en" pageKey="cookies" title="Cookie Settings" description="Allow or withdraw optional Google Analytics in this browser." noIndex={true}><main id="konten" class="policy-page"><a href="/en/" class="font-bold underline">Back to guide</a><h1 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Cookie Settings</h1><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">21 October 2026</p><article class="prose-legal mt-8"><p>Google Analytics is off by default. Permanent choices use local storage; a tab refusal is also stored for the session. There are no other preference or marketing features. This setting controls Google Analytics only. The hosting provider may separately add Cloudflare Web Analytics for page views and loading performance; this setting does not switch that measurement off.</p><form id="cookie-settings" class="card"><label class="cookie-label"><input id="analytics" type="checkbox" /> Allow Google Analytics</label><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button type="submit" class="button button-gold">Save choice</button><button data-cookie-reject type="button" class="button button-outline">Reject / withdraw</button></div><p data-consent-status role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mt-4"></p></form><p class="mt-6">The homepage Google Maps embed is separate and can send technical requests to Google. <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></p></article></main></BaseLayout>